    prijsNiet: 'Catalog and lifestyle images are priced per product and that rate falls as the count rises, because one setup is spread across more products. A hook is the setup — there is nothing to spread it over — so the figure is a floor and not a rate, and what moves it is the work rather than the count.',
    prijsCta: 'Talk to us about Hooks',
    formatH: 'What a hook looks like.',
    formatSub: 'Nothing here is a mock-up of someone else’s work. These are the places our own first hooks will go.',
    /* Dezelfde functie als c.tierNote op /video: TierCompare toont de twee
       serviceniveaus van de prijs per aantal, en geen van beide is met hooks te
