       bestelt wel degelijk wil. */
    tierNote: `The two columns below describe the price per quantity for catalog and lifestyle products. A hook is not on that ladder and does not count towards it, so ordering hooks does not reach either column — they are here because most brands who ask about a hook are ordering photos as well.`,
